<title>DENMARK: Danish December new car yr/yr sales rose 7.3 pct.</title>
<headline>Danish December new car yr/yr sales rose 7.3 pct.</headline>
<dateline>COPENHAGEN 1997-01-22</dateline>
<text>
<p>Danish new car registrations rose 7.3 percent in December 1996 to 8,905 from 8,303 a year earlier, the Automobile Importers' Society said on Wednesday.</p>
<p>It said 142,299 new cars were sold in Denmark in the whole year 1996, five percent more than in 1995.</p>
<p>				     Dec 1996   Dec 1995</p>
<p>    New car registrations	 8,905    8,303</p>
<p>Leading November registrations by manufacturer</p>
<p>    Volkswagen AG	 1,302</p>
<p>    Ford Motor Co	   844</p>
<p>    Toyota		    837</p>
<p>    General Motors Corp   782</p>
<p>-Steve Weizman,Copenhagen Newsroom, +45-33-969650</p>
